        "id": 1380243
      },
      "writtenOn": "2022-04-20T10:59:18Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "This is mostly here because it was in Hafnium, and it seemed like the optimisation might be worthwhile for David\u0027s unikernel. But in any case the point is that we can do what we need to in 32 instructions, so how would you suggest simplifying it?",
      "parentUuid": "4b34b704_e9a433e7",
